B.bnF=s(["L\xe8 limit jounen an rive, im\xe8l yo rete an atant epi yo pati otomatikman apre. Kontakte sip\xf2 GymDesk si gen im\xe8l pou korije oswa verifye.","Limite du jour atteinte : les emails restent en attente et partent automatiquement ensuite. Contactez le support GymDesk pour les emails \xe0 corriger ou v\xe9rifier.","When the daily limit is reached, emails stay queued and go out automatically later. Contact GymDesk support about emails needing correction or review."],t.s)
