B.aXh=s(["Pa gen PIN ki konfigire pou sesyon sa a.","Aucun PIN n\u2019est configur\xe9 pour cette session.","No PIN is configured for this session."],t.s)
B.b8w=s(["PIN an pa k\xf2r\xe8k.","PIN incorrect.","Incorrect PIN."],t.s)
B.bqt=s(["Tw\xf2p es\xe8. Tann tan an pase epi eseye ank\xf2.","Trop de tentatives. Attendez la fin du d\xe9lai puis r\xe9essayez.","Too many attempts. Wait for the cooldown and try again."],t.s)
